01:03:40,608 --> 01:03:44,570
TURNING AROUND WITH THE CAMERA

1556
01:03:48,616 --> 01:03:50,910
LAST ROUND ENDS

1557
01:03:50,993 --> 01:03:51,911
She's good.

1558
01:03:51,994 --> 01:03:54,288
- I'm so tired.
- She's so good.

1559
01:03:56,082 --> 01:03:58,376
I bet Kian was caught more than once.

1560
01:03:59,085 --> 01:04:00,378
CURIOUS

1561
01:04:01,838 --> 01:04:02,755
Who's this?

1562
01:04:02,839 --> 01:04:04,215
It's me.

1563
01:04:04,298 --> 01:04:05,633
So that's how it turned out.

1564
01:04:05,716 --> 01:04:06,592
He's praying.

1565
01:04:07,218 --> 01:04:08,135
Kian!

1566
01:04:08,219 --> 01:04:09,428
- Kian84!
- What?

1567
01:04:09,512 --> 01:04:10,388
KIAN AGAIN

1568
01:04:10,471 --> 01:04:11,722
You caught him so well.

1569
01:04:12,974 --> 01:04:14,350
<i>All the pictures look like this.</i>

1570
01:04:14,433 --> 01:04:15,309
KIAN A THIRD TIME

1571
01:04:16,227 --> 01:04:18,062
How do they all look the same?

1572
01:04:18,145 --> 01:04:19,939
All three are from the same angle.

1573
01:04:20,022 --> 01:04:20,982
They're the same shots

1574
01:04:21,065 --> 01:04:23,526
AMAZED

1575
01:04:23,609 --> 01:04:24,902
- You were below me, right?
- Yeah.

1576
01:04:24,986 --> 01:04:27,196
I only shot photos of people
moving around below me.

1577
01:04:27,280 --> 01:04:28,489
Click, click, click.

1578
01:04:29,031 --> 01:04:31,117
BLINDFOLDED PHOTO GAME COMES TO AN END

1579
01:04:31,200 --> 01:04:34,620
If you want to use the jacuzzi,
you can get changed and go up.

1580
01:04:34,704 --> 01:04:36,330
- Okay.
- Okay.

1581
01:04:36,414 --> 01:04:37,707
THE JACUZZI'S FULL NOW

1582
01:04:37,790 --> 01:04:39,208
Can we use the sauna too?

1583
01:04:39,292 --> 01:04:41,294
- Of course.
- Whatever you want.

1584
01:04:42,295 --> 01:04:44,714
THE JACUZZI'S FIRST GUEST IS?

1585
01:04:47,174 --> 01:04:49,302
YOUNGEST LUGER YOUNG-HYUN

1586
01:04:51,804 --> 01:04:53,055
EXHALES

1587
01:04:54,932 --> 01:04:56,267
Gosh, it's hot.

1588
01:05:01,314 --> 01:05:02,315
Goodness.

1589
01:05:03,190 --> 01:05:04,901
JUN-HO JOINS WITH TOWELS

1590
01:05:04,984 --> 01:05:06,736
How's the water up there? Is it warm?

1591
01:05:07,445 --> 01:05:09,488
CURIOUS

1592
01:05:10,072 --> 01:05:11,324
It's so good.

1593
01:05:11,407 --> 01:05:13,075
It's good? I should join.

1594
01:05:13,159 --> 01:05:15,328
It's warm? That's good.

1595
01:05:15,411 --> 01:05:16,996
RELIEVED

1596
01:05:17,079 --> 01:05:18,122
It's so warm.

1597
01:05:19,206 --> 01:05:20,041
It feels good.

1598
01:05:20,124 --> 01:05:21,918
A SUCCESSFUL OPENING FOR THE SINK JACUZZI

1599
01:05:22,752 --> 01:05:24,211
This is good enough.

1600
01:05:28,549 --> 01:05:30,885
- I said we should come here.
- Warm water's the best.

1601
01:05:34,221 --> 01:05:38,017
KIAN COMES INTO THE SAUNA

1602
01:05:38,809 --> 01:05:40,478
FOUR PEOPLE IN THE SAUNA

1603
01:05:40,561 --> 01:05:44,315
BOTH ARE OPEN

1604
01:05:45,191 --> 01:05:46,943
What made you apply for this?

1605
01:05:47,526 --> 01:05:50,363
I've never been
to Pyeongchang for vacation.

1606
01:05:50,446 --> 01:05:52,323
- You've never been on a trip here?
- No.

1607
01:05:52,406 --> 01:05:55,534
When we heard Kian's B&B would open here,

1608
01:05:56,202 --> 01:05:57,662
we decided to apply.

1609
01:05:57,745 --> 01:06:00,206
But do athletes like you have the time?

1610
01:06:00,289 --> 01:06:01,749
The season's over, so…

1611
01:06:01,832 --> 01:06:03,459
- It ended?
- Yes, today.

1612
01:06:03,542 --> 01:06:06,712
- Your last match was today?
- Today was the last competition.

1613
01:06:06,796 --> 01:06:08,506
CAME TO KIAN'S B&B
RIGHT AFTER SEASON'S END

1614
01:06:08,589 --> 01:06:13,052
So how does luge work exactly?

1615
01:06:13,135 --> 01:06:15,346
When you start, you begin seated.

1616
01:06:15,429 --> 01:06:19,517
Then, you paddle with spiked gloves on.

1617
01:06:19,600 --> 01:06:20,601
Like this?

1618
01:06:20,685 --> 01:06:24,063
Yes, you start like this,
and then you lie on your back.

1619
01:06:24,689 --> 01:06:26,607
What does the track look like?

1620
01:06:26,691 --> 01:06:27,650
From the mountain top…

1621
01:06:27,733 --> 01:06:29,568
- You race down the slope?
- Yes, that's right.

1622
01:06:30,152 --> 01:06:32,488
It's the same track for bobsleigh,
skeleton, and luge.

1623
01:06:32,571 --> 01:06:33,906
- The same for all three.
- Really?

1624
01:06:33,990 --> 01:06:34,907
All on one track.

1625
01:06:35,658 --> 01:06:37,868
- This might sound bad.
- Okay.

1626
01:06:37,952 --> 01:06:39,537
But I actually didn't know.

1627
01:06:39,620 --> 01:06:41,956
I've seen luge before,

1628
01:06:42,039 --> 01:06:43,582
but I'd never heard the name before.

1629
01:06:44,166 --> 01:06:46,627
We have to win medals
for it to become known.

1630
01:06:50,339 --> 01:06:52,675
Now that we've talked like this,

1631
01:06:52,758 --> 01:06:55,302
I want to see you guys
compete at the Olympics.

1632
01:06:55,386 --> 01:06:56,220
Seriously.

1633
01:06:56,303 --> 01:06:57,722
If we do, will you come?

1634
01:06:57,805 --> 01:06:59,807
If you really do,
I'll definitely be there.

1635
01:07:01,058 --> 01:07:02,601
I really hope you make it.

1636
01:07:08,733 --> 01:07:10,151
Want to go to the sauna?

1637
01:07:10,234 --> 01:07:11,277
Are there many people?

1638
01:07:11,360 --> 01:07:12,528
I think four people?

1639
01:07:12,611 --> 01:07:15,698
I think it'll be better to join them.

1640
01:07:16,323 --> 01:07:19,577
A LOT OF TIME PASSED WHILE THEY TALKED

1641
01:07:19,660 --> 01:07:21,996
It feels like it's getting cold.

1642
01:07:23,039 --> 01:07:24,707
Should we just go like this?

1643
01:07:24,790 --> 01:07:26,792
Dry off with a towel before you go down.

1644
01:07:26,876 --> 01:07:28,753
DRYING THEMSELVES WITH TOWELS

1645
01:07:34,383 --> 01:07:37,636
What's going on? It's so popular today.

1646
01:07:38,971 --> 01:07:41,057
The sauna's packed.

1647
01:07:41,140 --> 01:07:42,767
THE SAUNA'S SO POPULAR

1648
01:07:42,850 --> 01:07:44,685
It's overwhelmingly more popular.

1649
01:07:44,769 --> 01:07:47,480
It's so nice here. It smells good.
And I can sweat it out.

1650
01:07:47,563 --> 01:07:49,440
It's great once you get a taste.

1651
01:07:50,024 --> 01:07:52,485
KIAN ADDS WATER

1652
01:07:54,612 --> 01:07:55,946
Here it comes.

1653
01:07:57,573 --> 01:08:00,076
Yes, this is it.

1654
01:08:00,993 --> 01:08:02,870
That's what I'm talking about, Boss. Yes!

1655
01:08:02,953 --> 01:08:05,039
Today's been the best day at Kian's B&B.

1656
01:08:05,122 --> 01:08:06,123
This is it.

1657
01:08:06,207 --> 01:08:07,917
- Are you sweating?
- It's so nice.

1658
01:08:08,000 --> 01:08:09,460
I'm sweating a lot.

1659
01:08:09,543 --> 01:08:11,378
My pores have opened up.
I need to stay here.

1660
01:08:11,462 --> 01:08:12,505
Thirty more minutes.

1661
01:08:12,588 --> 01:08:13,964
PLANNING TO STAY 30 MINUTES MORE

1662
01:08:14,048 --> 01:08:15,341
Thirty minutes.

1663
01:08:20,179 --> 01:08:22,306
THE LIGHTS WENT OUT?

1664
01:08:22,389 --> 01:08:23,432
Someone turned them off.

1665
01:08:23,516 --> 01:08:25,267
FLUSTERED

1666
01:08:25,351 --> 01:08:26,268
What's going on?

1667
01:08:26,852 --> 01:08:28,646
- Boss.
- What's going on?

1668
01:08:29,522 --> 01:08:31,273
- This is scary.
- It is scary.

1669
01:08:31,357 --> 01:08:32,483
This is scary.

1670
01:08:35,986 --> 01:08:36,987
<i>Kian's B&B is…</i>

1671
01:08:37,905 --> 01:08:38,864
<i>all about teamwork.</i>

1672
01:08:38,948 --> 01:08:41,283
<i>- Focus.</i>
<i>- Six, seven, eight.</i>

1673
01:08:41,367 --> 01:08:42,576
<i>Nine, ten.</i>

1674
01:08:42,660 --> 01:08:44,662
Why are you flapping around so much?

1675
01:08:45,996 --> 01:08:47,915
<i>Hey, this is like a communal laundry spot.</i>

1676
01:08:47,998 --> 01:08:50,167
<i>Kian's B&B is all about stamina.</i>

1677
01:08:51,502 --> 01:08:52,837
<i>Where's Boss?</i>

1678
01:08:52,920 --> 01:08:55,005
My teeth are also part
of the cleaning area here.

1679
01:08:55,089 --> 01:08:56,132
Is that so?

1680
01:08:57,550 --> 01:08:59,468
<i>Geez, you're just creating more work.</i>

1681
01:08:59,552 --> 01:09:00,636
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>

1682
01:09:00,719 --> 01:09:01,679
<i>This is suffering.</i>

1683
01:09:01,762 --> 01:09:03,848
<i>The work is endless at Kian's B&B.</i>

1684
01:09:04,515 --> 01:09:06,475
- No!
- He made a big mess.

1685
01:09:08,853 --> 01:09:09,937
Why are you making her cry?

1686
01:09:10,020 --> 01:09:11,355
Get it together!

1687
01:09:12,523 --> 01:09:13,482
What's that?

1688
01:09:13,566 --> 01:09:14,400
Who is that?

1689
01:09:14,483 --> 01:09:16,986
- It's snowing hard.
- There was a heavy-snow alert.

1690
01:09:17,069 --> 01:09:18,487
<i>Why did it snow so much?</i>

1691
01:09:18,571 --> 01:09:19,697
<i>The door wouldn't open.</i>

1692
01:09:19,780 --> 01:09:21,574
<i>Hey, the building's collapsing.</i>

1693
01:09:22,241 --> 01:09:23,325
<i>We're not stuck, right?</i>

1694
01:09:23,409 --> 01:09:24,577
<i>We're stuck.</i>

1695
01:09:24,660 --> 01:09:26,287
<i>We need to shovel the snow.</i>

1696
01:09:26,370 --> 01:09:27,913
<i>Clearing snow is our job.</i>

1697
01:09:27,997 --> 01:09:29,623
<i>Isn't the snow here clean?</i>

1698
01:09:33,377 --> 01:09:34,795
<i>They're fighting again.</i>

1699
01:09:34,879 --> 01:09:36,046
<i>Want to make a snowman?</i>

1700
01:09:40,467 --> 01:09:44,221
KIAN'S BIZARRE B&B SEASON 2

1701
01:10:31,977 --> 01:10:33,979
Subtitle translation by: Wayne Ryu
